    {
      "id": "1539355916837584937",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2026-08-18T21:30:50.424+02:00",
      "timestampEdited": "2026-08-26T20:42:43.806+02:00",
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "**Pregunta 9** -> En el commit \"validation: make 64-byte transactions invalid\" se invalidan las transacciones de exactamente 64 bytes, no las de 64 o menos. ¿Por qué exactamente 64? ¿Por qué `MIN_STANDARD_TX_NONWITNESS_SIZE` se queda en 65?\n¿Aplica también al coinbase?",
      "author": {
        "id": "730259133240049675",
        "name": "andreadcorreia",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "Andrea Díaz Correia",
        "color": "#992D22",
        "isBot": false,
        "roles": [
          {
            "id": "1483542958153138197",
            "name": "PR Proposer",
            "color": "#992D22",
            "position": 1
          }
        ],
        "avatarUrl": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatars/730259133240049675/dff04a584f5e8dca1460f34405d25adb.png?size=512"
